#: porch/de-porch-settings.php:18
msgid "Praying that people around the globe would hear the Gospel"
msgstr ""

#: porch/de-porch-settings.php:19
msgid "The internet and social media give us extraordinary access to get the gospel to people worldwide. Join us in praying for these digital outreach efforts to be effective."
msgstr ""

#: porch/de-porch-settings.php:20
msgid "May the cries of God’s children be a sweet sound of praise! Join us in fervently praying that the Holy Spirit would draw people to repentance."
msgstr ""

#: porch/de-porch-settings.php:21
msgid "Digital Engagement"
msgstr ""

#: porch/de-porch-settings.php:22
msgid "May the digital, technological, and artistic skills of God’s people cause those who are in darkness to pause and consider their position before the Creator of the Universe."
msgstr ""

#: porch/de-porch-settings.php:23
msgid "Over the next several weeks, there will be a concentrated effort to share the gospel with people in our region using social media and web platforms. As we bring light to these digital dark places, there will be opposition. Join us in praying fervently for God to use these digital engagement efforts for His name and glory."
msgstr ""

